<title>RUSSIA: Russian shares slip, seen down on domestic sales.</title>
<headline>Russian shares slip, seen down on domestic sales.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading Russian shares sank in early trade on Wednesday as domestic operators sold stocks on sporadic profit-taking as recent gains appear to have stalled for now, traders said, predicting the market would ease further.</p>
</text>
